# (the recipe numbers quoted in the comments below are the old SAMSARA pieces'; the expectations are the sci-fi ones')
# the pieces: PRESETS picks one, each remembers its settings, SAVE held resets one, all saved
# (SAMSARA's four: Cryosleep, Derelict, Hyperlane, Terraform)
wait 500
expect piece 0
# Cryosleep's pad down (the Pad page: ENV)
tap ENV
spin K1 -10
expect par0 55
# the next piece: Derelict, its recipe (tempo 70, the Ground at 35, bells 60, Bb Mixolydian)
turn PRESET 1
expect piece 1
expect par18 52
expect par3 15
expect par1 50
expect par19 3
expect pool 0x5AB
wait 20000
shot maranasati.png
expect pad_level >10
# the pad's colour (the Pad page's fourth knob), kept with the piece (Derelict starts as Voices)
expect par22 5
spin K4 -1
expect par22 4
wait 3000
# and Hyperlane (tempo 84, G Lydian), Terraform (tempo 64, no Ground, E pentatonic major)
turn PRESET 1
expect piece 2
expect par18 96
expect par19 7
wait 8000
shot anatta.png
turn PRESET 1
expect piece 3
expect par18 68
expect par3 30
wait 8000
shot nirvana.png
# back to Cryosleep: as it was left (its pad's colour is the Choir, 2, since 2026-11-14)
turn PRESET -3
expect par22 4
expect piece 0
expect par0 55
spin K4 -1
expect par22 3
turn PRESET 1
expect par22 4
turn PRESET -1
expect par22 3
# SAVE held: Cryosleep's recipe again
press SAVE
wait 1700
release SAVE
expect par0 65
expect par22 4
expect store_writes 0
# a tweak, saved, survives a reboot, on the piece it was made on (the Bells page: ARP)
tap ARP
spin K1 5
expect par1 50
turn PRESET 3
expect piece 3
tap SAVE
expect store_writes 1
reboot
wait 300
expect piece 3
# one past the last piece is the first again (eight pieces: Perihelion, Aphelion, Horizon and Pulsar follow Terraform)
turn PRESET 4
expect piece 7
turn PRESET 1
expect piece 0
expect par1 50
